    {
      "turn": 2,
      "doctor_question": "How long have you been feeling like these people at work are tracking your buys and messing with your numbers?",
      "targeted_symptom": "psychotic_symptoms_duration",
      "patient_response": "Um, I'd say roughly ten months now. I know because it started right around the time we were locking in the summer seasonal buys. Which, by the way, the shipping logistics for summer stuff is just a total nightmare now. We had these inflatable pools coming in from overseas, and you can actually track the cargo ships online. Have you ever done that? It's actually crazy, there's this website where you can see every single ship in the ocean, just these little green dots moving so slowly. I spent like three days just watching the dots once when a container was late. My buddy used to work at the port and he said the seagulls down there are massive, like the size of small dogs, and they'll just steal a sandwich right out of your hand if you aren't paying attention... but anyway, yeah, it's been about ten months of knowing they're messing with my numbers. And, um, that's also when the voice started happening, too. So roughly ten months for all of it.",
