    {
      "turn": 4,
      "doctor_question": "When you have those stretches where you feel amazing and full of energy, do the feelings that people are tracking your work and the voice you hear continue to happen during those times, or do they only happen when your mood is not elevated?",
      "targeted_symptom": "additional_requirement_1",
      "patient_response": "Oh, no, they definitely keep happening. Even when I'm in that zone. Like, there were a couple weeks where I was barely sleeping at all, just totally wired, and I was talking nonstop to anyone who would listen about these new sneaker trends. Sneaker culture is wild right now, by the way. People are paying like thousands of dollars for shoes they never even wear, they just keep them in these clear plastic boxes like a museum. My cousin tried to start a business cleaning sneakers, bought all these special brushes and foams, but he ended up ruining a guy's vintage Jordans and got sued. He had to sell his car to pay for it, which was a shame because it was this really nice old Honda Civic, the kind you can actually work on yourself without needing a computer to diagnose every little thing... but yeah, anyway, even when I was feeling totally untouchable at work during those weeks, I was still completely convinced the vendors were manipulating my numbers. And the voice was there too, just kind of pushing me, telling me I had to move faster, buy faster. So yeah, the tracking and the voice don't go away just because I feel amazing.",
